{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/99011-some-trouble-reading-the-demon-book","id":99011,"title":"Some trouble reading the Demon book","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-26T00:50:56-07:00","id":99011,"title":"Some trouble reading the Demon book","content":"I recently got the new Demon book (in PDF format from DriveThruRPG) and I just started giving it a look over. On a quick look through, there is a problem with reading some of the text. For example, on p. 37 in the sidebar (I think it is called a sidebar), the text is white on a background that a has a pattern varies between black and white and different shades of grey. These moments of a white background makes it difficult to read the white text. There are other instances like that throughout the book. I'm hoping for a fix to this problem.<br /> <br /> P.S. Is there an errata thread made yet? I would have posted there if I could find one...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/536-divinewrath","name":"DivineWrath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T05:51:01-07:00","id":99081,"title":"","content":"Im looking at that very page and it reads perfectly clear on my ipad and my desktop. Id say its your reader or your settings. In any case why would this be an errata?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","name":"JoeB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar311_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T09:22:16-07:00","id":99223,"title":"","content":"The Antinomians box on page 37? To me, it's white text on a consistently dark purple background... no white or light colors in the background at all. I just tried it in Adobe Reader and FoxIt on my PC, and in GoodReader on my iPad. What platform are you using?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T11:29:49-07:00","id":99334,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/99011-some-trouble-reading-the-demon-book?p=99223#post99223\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Antinomians box on page 37?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, that part.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/99011-some-trouble-reading-the-demon-book?p=99223#post99223\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To me, it's white text on a consistently dark purple background... no white or light colors in the background at all. I just tried it in Adobe Reader and FoxIt on my PC, and in GoodReader on my iPad. What platform are you using?</div> </div> </div> </div>Purple? The whole file looks black and white to me. I even took a screen shot and opened with microsoft paint. I took a color sample and went to determine what mix of colors it was, and it was a very dark color. I see no evidence that there was supposed be any colors at all in that book. Other files I open with Adobe do have color (if they are supposed to have color).<br /> <br /> My Adobe Reader is version 11.0.06 . I checked for updates and it seems that is the latest version. I'm using Windows 7 Ultimate.<br /> <br /> The version of the demon book was last updated on 2014-03-21, and the file name is Demon_the_Descent_Revised_(Download).pdf .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/536-divinewrath","name":"DivineWrath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T12:04:55-07:00","id":99377,"title":"","content":"I'm using Reader 11.0.06 on Windows 8, with the same version of the file. There should definitely be purple in the book -- it's duotone, so there's black and white as well as shades of purple. Is the cover (the first page of the file) in shades of purple?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T12:15:00-07:00","id":99385,"title":"","content":"I have no issue reading the book at all (including the Antinomians sidebar) but the purple surprised me as well. It looks mostly greyscale to me but if I reeeeally squint maybe I can see shades of blue on the cover page. The only things that I can definitely say are colored are the WW and Onyx Path logo on the very last page and when there are bullet points the background of some of them is sort of grey sort of blue-ish","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2108-genesis","name":"genesis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T12:35:33-07:00","id":99415,"title":"","content":"I'm using Adobe 11.0.06 on Windows 7 and am having some trouble reading sidebars as well. The purple is quite dark, and some of the speckled background comes out as almost the same shade as the text in some of the textboxes (e.g., pg 37, pg 63, pg 67); a lot of the text can be made out with context or by highlighting, but it's definitely a tad frustrating.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1833-agnelcow","name":"Agnelcow","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T12:40:33-07:00","id":99424,"title":"","content":"No. There is no color on on the cover of the file.<br /> <br /> Looking at the details more carefully, what I see in edit colors might shed some light. When I edit colors, it is kinda like a chart. Going left to right, you can go through the different colors. Going up or down, an you can adjust how much dark is involved. All the colors I see are really dark (about 1/10th the way from the very bottom). If I were able to move all a colors up away from being very dark, then maybe I would get a file with colors. This might suggest that some happened to make everything really dark. Most of the colors I've sampled are in the blue or purple range, but are too dark to matter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/536-divinewrath","name":"DivineWrath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T12:48:05-07:00","id":99433,"title":"","content":"Using 11.0.06 on Windows 8 and I see the same thing I think. The background is a speckled black, gray and white in those text boxes. White text on white is problematic <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. Doesn't look purple. The cover and edges do have a dark purple color.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/463-derendel","name":"Derendel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar463_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T12:51:42-07:00","id":99436,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DivineWrath</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/99011-some-trouble-reading-the-demon-book?p=99334#post99334\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Purple? The whole file looks black and white to me...</div> </div> </div> </div>Mine doesn't look completely black-and-white, but I only see much colour in the charts with alternating light/dark lines. Anything with that 'marbled' background on the PDFs (whether viewed on my Mac, my Windows 7 PC, my iPad Mini, or my Samsung Galaxy 3.7 Android tablet) all render letters unreadable if there's a white spot behind it. 'Secret Origins' on page 25 IS readable with a background that isn't overwhelming, but 'Gender Identity and Demons' (and all the rest that follow) are a LOT harder to read.<br /> <br /> I only chime in here because I thought it was just MY copy/devices/eyes or whatnot that had a problem reading it. All of my software and the file are, as <b>DivineWrath</b> also suggests, up to date. Dunno what's going on, but at least I'm not the only one!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>B.I.G. Bird spreads the word: Anybody with a heart votes love<br /> <a href=\"https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/</a></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/409-phaolan","name":"Phaolan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"478"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T13:02:32-07:00","id":99446,"title":"","content":"I honestly have no idea. I've reported it to the folks who understand PDFs better than I do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T13:13:54-07:00","id":99457,"title":"","content":"Alright. I hope to hear good news then.<br /> <br /> If need be, you guys could do without a fancy background. Sometimes you guys do fancy things that turn out to be too fancy (like hand written text in the vampire books), that hurt readability.<br /> <br /> By the way Rose, is the file you are looking at from DriveThru, or did you get a copy strait from the folks who make the PDFs? If so, then maybe the file you have and the one we got are different.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":536,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/536-divinewrath","user":"DivineWrath","date":". 03-26-2014, 04:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/536-divinewrath","name":"DivineWrath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T13:21:02-07:00","id":99469,"title":"","content":"Here's what we see on page 37, scaled down a bit.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.saberpunk.net/temp/Pages%20from%20Demon_the_Descent_Revised_(Download).jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"im